{"id":"dhgpghevmlzpjudt51vvfzkvu","title":"思想之书·2·1、认知方法论（语言哲学）","originalTitle":null,"summary":"认知方法论是从“存在”到“认知”的过程，通过定义事物促进意识的认识，从依赖具体形态的意识转变为依赖抽象符号关联的意识。定义后，认知范围也会扩大，适用于更广泛的相似事物。认知方法论是思想的起点，但其本身也具有逻辑局限和思维囚禁的特性，理解其作用对深入理解哲学体系至关重要。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=1767125&do=blog&id=1561633"},"publishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":"2026-11-18T05:38:13.853Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-18T05:38:13.853Z","category":"ai-frontier","tags":["论文发表","研究成果"],"score":17,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}